{
 "about": "[C6] Proof 1 of WAVE_C §7 for chapter V: the player does nothing and LOSES, in every stretch of the chase - the escape down the iron, the alley, the lane, the yard, the kitchen, the press hall, the avenue under the el, over (the fork), the street, the car - each started cold (?start=watcher.<beat>): \"He's getting away.\" first (at least a second), then \"Lost him.\", back at the start of that stretch. node tools/play.mjs tools/plays/watcher_idle.json",
